WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Make Facebook Reels feel like a proper desktop player.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.150
Open Voltura Reel Player and take the reel fullscreen.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.500
Scrub to a moment, then step through it a tenth of a second at a time.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.750
Drag the handles to repeat a section.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.100
Slow it down, or speed it up.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:22.000
Zoom in, pan to the detail, and save a paused frame as a full resolution PNG.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.000
Move between reels without leaving fullscreen.

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:27.620
Pick a theme and make the controls your own.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.230
Voltura Reel Player, for Chrome.

